        {
          "path": "_m/r/0/x/f/cradle-mountain-lake-st-clair-national-park-wk/for-the-people-for-all-time-fl.jpg",
          "filename": "\"...for the people for all time.\" - Flickr - brewbooks.jpg",
          "caption": "The Monument Above\nmarks the grave of\nGustav Weindorfer\n(1874-1932)\nAn Austrian migrant, founder of Waldheim, who as pioneer, host &amp; guide, with boundless interest in this beautiful area, worked tirelessly to ensure its preservation as a National Park, and in Gustav's words:\n\"...for the people for all time.\"\nen.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gustav_Weindorfer\n\noz9 109",
